    <h1>House Inventory System - Quickstart Guide</h1>
    <p>This guide serves as step-by-step instructions for launching the House Inventory application.</p>

    <h2>How to Launch the Application</h2>
    <ol>
        <li>Open the House-Inventory-System project folder on your computer.</li>
        <li>Navigate to the code folder, then open the HouseInventory_Project folder.</li>
        <li>Open the terminal and use cd command to navigate into House-Inventory-System/code/HouseInventory_Project folder.</li>
        <li>Run the command mvn javafx:run to launch the application.</li>
        <li>Wait for the House Inventory application window to open. Once it opens, the application is ready to go.</li>
    </ol>

